badsala Column","tags":[],"note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༆༦༅༢༭༪༆༚༆༹༃༠༚༮༜༨༭༤༭༇༾༘༘༃༅༑༂༗༁༹༭༸༓༉༌༖༁༥༲༈༵༼༰༠༴༛༗༓༅༇༥༧༠༥༣༼༁༁༌༡༊༺༒༾༽༻༨༙་༿༹༸༃</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":766,"y":360.79,"cell":6049,"i":109,"name":"Asto Column","tags":[],"note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༚༛༣༃༾༚༤༉༿༜༳༫ༀ༥༔༡༷༾༗༨༬༠༁༣༧༹༗༐༈༙༳༴༼ༀ༢༦༳༚༢༪</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":91.1,"y":791.84,"cell":13150,"i":110,"name":"Leialopo Megalith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳲⳞⳁⳘ⳹ⲲⲸⲾⲾⳂⲲ⳩Ⳑ⳹ⳠⲸⳫ⳩ⳤⲸⳠ ⳃ⳪  ⲶⳐ⳾ Ⲻ⳪ⲴⳐ⳹Ⳳ⳩⳪ⳢⳄⳲⲼⳐ⳾Ⳇ⳥Ⳬ ⳌⳁⳭⲼⳂⳤⲲⳁⳂⳢⳭ⳧ ⳢⲼ⳪ⳂⲶⳃⳀⲺⳊ⳾ⳭⳐ⳥ⳃⲺⲶ⳪ ⳖⲲⳬ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":183.23,"y":315.8,"cell":5210,"i":111,"name":"Mullinheim Idol","tags":[],"note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༠༱ༀ༠༨༜༌༌༑༠༃༲༊༭༓༨༅༂༉༑༮༚༛༪༤༂༙༢༱༿༚༂༙༂༂༭༷༣༱༻༮༪༗༑༻༌༈༹༲༛༓༤༪</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":576.88,"y":161.32,"cell":2708,"i":112,"name":"Gaintza Effigy","tags":[],"note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸሠሰ ፀሰ ሐከመየለ ሠገፀፐሐ ፀሰገወዐጠ አወአ ሠሐለአሐሰ ከየነቀ ሰዘ መበ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":362.64,"y":239.54,"cell":4018,"i":113,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":169.14,"y":48.48,"cell":808,"i":114,"name":"Ruined Fortress","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":69.4,"y":706.3,"cell":11550,"i":115,"name":"Ruined Fort","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":187.1,"y":184.3,"cell":2910,"i":116,"name":"Ruined Outpost","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":234.42,"y":413.42,"cell":6796,"i":117,"name":"Ruined Outpost","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":402.06,"y":773.4,"cell":12922,"i":118,"name":"Ruined Temple","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":143.19,"y":599.23,"cell":9689,"i":119,"name":"Ruined City","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":731.6,"y":436.1,"cell":7077,"i":120,"name":"Lazpeibar Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":629.45,"y":367.39,"cell":6149,"i":121,"name":"Bertandegor Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":503.52,"y":492.78,"cell":8003,"i":122,"name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":675.35,"y":762.62,"cell":12831,"i":123,"name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":523.3,"y":261,"cell":4316,"i":124,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":123.71,"y":609.21,"cell":9818,"i":125,"name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":162.33,"y":194.34,"cell":3169,"i":126,"name":"Elztal Competition","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a competition of might in Elztal, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":520.43,"y":248.49,"cell":4177,"i":127,"name":"Leta Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Leta, offering local wood, preserved food, and boots alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":318.62,"y":456.3,"cell":7349,"i":128,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Marajapemi Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":185.73,"y":189.64,"cell":3038,"i":129,"name":"Frogs migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of frogs are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f483-1f3fd","type":"dances","x":284.11,"y":416.06,"cell":6802,"i":130,"name":"Feldbad jubilee","tags":[],"note":"A jubilee has been organised at Feldbad as a chance to gather the great and the good of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":600.67,"y":377.55,"cell":6275,"i":131,"name":"Lezurandia Fracture","tags":[],"note":"The Lezurandia Fracture. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":502.05,"y":335.09,"cell":5650,"i":132,"name":"Valkeakan Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":488.46,"y":349.77,"cell":5880,"i":133,"name":"Random encounter",